                                    {
                                        <p class="mb-0">This is a <strong>Double Wall Box</strong> calculation with both 3-Ply and 5-Ply layers for extra strength. Prices include all material, production, and setup costs with your specified @Model.Input.ProfitPercent% profit margin.</p>
                                    }
                                    else
                                    {
                                        <p class="mb-0">This is a <strong>Single Wall Box</strong> calculation with 3-Ply construction. Prices include all material, production, and setup costs with your specified @Model.Input.ProfitPercent% profit margin.</p>
